.TH "PB-CONFIG-LOCAL-ACCESS-DOMAIN-RESET" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-config-local-access-domain-reset - Restore the default local browser domain


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb config local-access domain reset [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Restore local.pprbt.dev as this client's browser domain and apply the change. The helper and trust state are reconciled before success is printed; configured named services remain attached to their existing machine ports.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for reset

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-config-local-access-domain(1)\fP
